-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 44.75pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>التصنيف ***</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"91\" style=\"width: 68.2pt; border-top: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-color-alt: windowtext; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 44.75pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>المرة الأولى</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"92\" style=\"width: 69.25pt; border-top: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-color-alt: windowtext; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 44.75pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>المرة الثانية</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"92\" style=\"width: 69.25pt; border-top: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-bo