ckground-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>تصنيف ( أ )</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"91\" style=\"width: 68.2pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">غرامة 5.000 ريال</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"92\" style=\"width: 69.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">غرامة 10.000 ريال</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"92\" style=\"width: 69.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double windowtext 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">غرامة 20.000 ريال</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"139\" style=\"width: 104.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: double windowtext 1.5pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: double 1.5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid .5pt; mso-border-color-alt: windowtext; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 90%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">تضاعف الغرامة في حال تكرار المخالفة خلال ثلاث سنوات من ارتكابها</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<td width=\"82\" style=\"width: 61.8pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DEEAF6; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 45.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 2.0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 90%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>تصنيف ( ب )</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"91\" style=\"width: 68.2pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DEEAF6; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-the